# Workflow Validator - Credential Configuration
#
# This skill does NOT require its own credentials.
# It loads credentials from the respective tool directories:
#
# - GitHub Projects: Uses `gh` CLI authentication (run: gh auth login)
# - Jira: Loads from ~/.claude/credentials/jira/{account}.env
# - Notion: Loads from ~/.claude/credentials/notion/{account}.env
# - Linear: Loads from ~/.claude/credentials/linear/{account}.env
#
# To configure credentials for each tool:
#   sf tools add jira my-account
#   sf tools add notion my-account
#   sf tools add linear my-account
#
# For GitHub Projects, authenticate the gh CLI:
#   gh auth login
#
# No .env file is needed for this skill.
